  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>The city of Menton has set up fenced, secured spaces reserved for dogs, with a water point, to let them socialise and play off the leash.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>This is official information from Menton town hall (the "Facilities for dog owners" page on menton.fr): Parc Garavan, below Parc du Pian (10 avenue Blasco Ibañez), is confirmed open and fenced. The same page mentions a second area near the chemin de la Madone, whose completion status is not guaranteed — worth checking on site before heading there specifically for that reason.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: according to the same official page, Menton also has 3 beaches that allow dogs (Gorbio, Casino, Hawaï/Garavan) — a good way to combine a walk with a swim.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Parc du Pian and the Garavan area, on the Italian border, offer some lovely walks to round off the visit.</p>
